{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-89685f44298f06b16656a97327313e257f9b808a50eb043a","family_id":"KR:013220","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"ENFORCEMENT DECREE OF THE ACT ON MANAGEMENT OF FIREFIGHTING EQUIPMENT","title_original":"소방장비관리법 시행령","kind":"대통령령","source_version":"287377","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=287377","source_sha256":"5ec8ed6d9986beb9b06e27df3fdfd117ffbb23733f907e5568d570449f38d7fc","body_sha256":"e6f15d8e5bc011f16803387a4a5c73129c7c9bebf400271c45f95070db078bf2","article_count":0,"full_text":"■ Enforcement Decree of the Act on Management of Firefighting Equipment [Attached Table 5] <Amended on May 15, 2023>\n\nCriteria for Calculation of Fees for Services Performed on Behalf of Another (Re: Article 46)\n\n1. Criteria for calculation of fees for inspection, etc. of fire equipment\n\n(a) The standards for consideration for engineering projects under Article 31 of the Engineering Industry Promotion Act shall apply mutatis mutandis to the fees.\n\n(b) For labor costs, the wage rates for the machinery and equipment sector among the wage rates for engineering technicians shall apply.\n\n(c) The engineering technicians under item (b) shall be classified and applied as follows:\n\n1) Education of operators of fire equipment: One high-grade engineering technician;\n\n2) Inspection: One intermediate-grade engineering technician;\n\n3) Detailed inspection: Two intermediate-grade engineering technicians.\n\n(d) Standard person-days shall be calculated by dividing the time required for inspection, etc. by eight working hours per day.\n\n2. Calculation of fees\n\n(a) Each fee for education of operators of fire equipment, inspection and detailed inspection shall be the sum of direct labor costs, direct expenses, other expenses and technical fees calculated as follows:\n\n1) Direct labor costs shall be calculated by multiplying standard person-days by the labor costs prescribed in paragraph 1 (b).\n\n2) Direct expenses shall be 20% of direct labor costs.\n\n3) Other expenses shall be 110% of direct labor costs.\n\n4) Technical fees shall be 20% of the sum of direct labor costs and other expenses.\n\n(b) Amounts below 1,000 won shall be discarded from the costs calculated under item (a).\n\n(c) Accommodation and meal expenses necessary for education of operators of fire equipment shall be calculated separately from the fees under item (a).","metadata":{"author_checks":["All current held source unit text, source editorial notes, amounts, periods, exceptions and source omission boundaries compared.","Unchanged official English retained only in the recorded exact source/target spans; original row, role, provider, edition, links and receipts remain unchanged.","New affected units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION / UNREVIEWED; source graphics remain linked to actual unchanged assets.","Source unit keys, order and full-text SHA matched the frozen inventory."],"author_method":"Direct assistant translation of exact held Korean source; complete explicit source units with source-order and UTF-8 SHA checks.","author_self_check_record":{"path":"\\\\100.90.87.105\\YOLLA-D\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1521_KR013050\\translations\\decree\\en.units.parts\\annex-000500E.selfcheck.json","sha256":"50e176c8ef45f1d88176fa90ae2b23e4a9f7d8a6315c445fb3b8d51e9d08a892"},"body_and_addenda_complete":false,"component_id":"DECREE:kr-013220-287377-ko","component_ids":["DECREE:kr-013220-287377-ko:annex-000500E"],"component_kind":"DECREE","edition_id":"edition-5ab2a19b19eb0df0623363b4150efed54ea5b269bce5b268","english_gap_scope_plan":{"path":"\\\\100.90.87.105\\YOLLA-D\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1521_KR013050\\direct_ingest_v1\\english_gap_scope_plan_v1.json","r